(That said, mostly the commies I've met here are reasonable, kind people...)

let me check:

"the same"

yes, it looks like I can

so, a red carpet can look wooly

for me, when a red carpet looks wooly, it's because i'm somewhere i've never been doing something i've never done at a time in which i wasn't alive:

it's 1953 & i'm smoking tobacco out of a big wooden pipe in a fine mahogany & leather library in France

@thetetra.space is both right & one of the only people with the high tier taste to call a bluesky post a "bisk"

I think we independently converged to this name scheme

I'm sure that's not the tetra's best feature or anything but it is the first thing I think of when i think of them hahaha

@yonderdavid.bsky.social disputes the reality of desertification

but, the world wonders:

what of dessertification?

@norvid-studies.bsky.social if you don't bestow me with one measly like so help me god but I am going to be starved into nothingness

I am going to be shriveled

I am going to be an indiscrimanable husk of a hollowed out nothing pumpkin

i appreciate tremendously your connection between hegelianism & the work of janus & the borgs

if perhaps i saw earlier than you the alchemy (i knew in my heart when i saw the dungeon), i'm otherwise not so clever; & have meanwhile lost a bit of faith:

"it feels too slow," i think, still wondering

eenie meenie miny mail,
grab a tiger by the tail,
if he's running hold on tight,
dragged into the jungle night,
if you slip then you will die,
so best believe that man can fly!

